  <div class="two-column">
    <div class="column">
      <h3 class="section-title">CARS "ON DEMAND"</h3>
      <p>If you need wheels to get around the city and do not have a car of your own, you're in luck.</p>
      <p><strong>Zipcar</strong></p>
      <p>Boston features plenty of Zipcar locations near Suffolk's campus. Visit <span data-field="zipcar_url">{{ zipcar_url }}</span> to register for a carcard, locate where available cars live, and then go to that location and use your car to unlock your car and go. Best of all, Suffolk has partnered with this company for savings! Members of the Suffolk community can register for as little as <span data-field="zipcar_fee">{{ zipcar_fee }}</span>, and may pay as little as <span data-field="zipcar_daily_rate">{{ zipcar_daily_rate }}</span> an hour and <span data-field="zipcar_weekly_rate">{{ zipcar_weekly_rate }}</span> a day.</p>

      <h3 class="section-title">Campus Bike Racks</h3>
      <p>Bike racks are located at <span data-field="bike_rack_location_1">{{ bike_rack_location_1 }}</span> on the Somerset Street side, in the Sargent Hall garage, and at <span data-field="bike_rack_location_2">{{ bike_rack_location_2 }}</span> (by the Tremont Place entrance to the Sawyer Library).</p>

      <h3 class="section-title">Blue Bikes</h3>
      <p>This bike-share initiative features bikes racks throughout the city (and many are close to campus). Once you've registered and received your key in the mail, you can take a bike from any location, ride it as long as you need it, and return it to any rack location. The first 30 minutes of any ride are free! Visit <span data-field="blue_bikes_url">{{ blue_bikes_url }}</span> for more information.</p>

      <h3 class="section-title">Lockers</h3>
      <p>Your textbooks don't have to commute to campus with you. Call Facilities Management at <span data-field="locker_phone">{{ locker_phone }}</span> to request a locker for storing your school supplies. Law students should register online for a locker at <span data-field="locker_url">{{ locker_url }}</span>.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="column">
      <h3 class="section-title">BIKING IN BOSTON</h3>
      <p>More and more, Boston is becoming a bicycle-friendly city. Bring your bike to campus or get one when you need one. Visit <span data-field="city_bike_url">{{ city_bike_url }}</span> is a great resource for cyclists.</p>

      <h3 class="section-title">Campus Bike Racks</h3>
